{"4795460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Citadel Project", "steam_appid": 4795460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5111940], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Citadel Project is a solo-developed pure first-person stealth game with survival horror elements, set in a Dark Fantasy environment. No combat, no magic spells, ...; just stealth, assassination, and the tools at your disposal to survive and avoid danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Citadel Project, the last line of defense built by the Ancient Kings in an attempt to preserve what remains of humanity in the face of the Great Storm. Unfortunately, an evil force is consuming it from within... Will you be able to navigate the nightmarish, labyrinthine architecture of this mega-structure and uncover what happened?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are nobody, just a simple prisoner who manages to escape from a cell deep within the Citadel. With only a few tools at your disposal, you must survive and find your way through its alleys and labyrinths, now turned deadly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the shadows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/52c3c02ed33c1663ee3e197925401f88.poster.avif?t=1788167753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/52c3c02ed33c1663ee3e197925401f88.webm?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/52c3c02ed33c1663ee3e197925401f88.mp4?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must remain silent and, above all, unseen by the many dangers lurking within the Citadel. The Citadel Project features a complex lighting system that dynamically calculates your exposure to every light source, allowing you to take advantage of every area of darkness, or even create your own using the tools at your disposal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eliminate your enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/1d01ee4b9eab376f1d94dba9c3990d37.poster.avif?t=1788167753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/1d01ee4b9eab376f1d94dba9c3990d37.webm?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/1d01ee4b9eab376f1d94dba9c3990d37.mp4?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These infected guards and civilians are a real threat, and the infection makes it impossible to kill them by normal means, but if you are stealthy enough, you can tear out the gangrenous growths on their backs. Be careful, don't leave bodies in plain sight, or the entire area will be alerted...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your brain, push away</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/8aa3cb5386d1db7094381edc912e07f8.poster.avif?t=1788167753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/8aa3cb5386d1db7094381edc912e07f8.webm?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/8aa3cb5386d1db7094381edc912e07f8.mp4?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you can't fight and defeat infected enemies, you can still use your force to push away your foes, on the ground, off a cliff, on thorned barricad, … or even fall on them from above. Use the verticality of the Citadel architecture so that your enemies will no longer be a threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One crossbow, multiple bolts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/5d00990b1bfaedbf8cc631d1e9bba0b4.poster.avif?t=1788167753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/5d00990b1bfaedbf8cc631d1e9bba0b4.webm?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/5d00990b1bfaedbf8cc631d1e9bba0b4.mp4?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main tool for surviving and progressing through the Citadel is your crossbow. Various types of bolts can be found throughout your journey, each offering new possibilities. Stay hidden and extinguish torches, reach new heights with rope bolts, or eliminate threats with fire bolts, the choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore your environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/cb1893d7cfa448c0f8a1ed09ea7fdfa9.poster.avif?t=1788167753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/cb1893d7cfa448c0f8a1ed09ea7fdfa9.webm?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/cb1893d7cfa448c0f8a1ed09ea7fdfa9.mp4?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the time to explore your surroundings and discover useful resources such as ammunition, secret relics, precious artifacts and notes detailing the Citadel's history. More importantly, careful exploration may reveal new paths forward through the vast depths of the mega-structure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More incoming...</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Citadel Project is a solo-developed pure first-person stealth game with survival horror elements, set in a Dark Fantasy environment. No combat, no magic spells, ...; just stealth, assassination, and the tools at your disposal to survive and avoid danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Citadel Project, the last line of defense built by the Ancient Kings in an attempt to preserve what remains of humanity in the face of the Great Storm. Unfortunately, an evil force is consuming it from within... Will you be able to navigate the nightmarish, labyrinthine architecture of this mega-structure and uncover what happened?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are nobody, just a simple prisoner who manages to escape from a cell deep within the Citadel. With only a few tools at your disposal, you must survive and find your way through its alleys and labyrinths, now turned deadly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the shadows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/52c3c02ed33c1663ee3e197925401f88.poster.avif?t=1788167753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/52c3c02ed33c1663ee3e197925401f88.webm?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/52c3c02ed33c1663ee3e197925401f88.mp4?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must remain silent and, above all, unseen by the many dangers lurking within the Citadel. The Citadel Project features a complex lighting system that dynamically calculates your exposure to every light source, allowing you to take advantage of every area of darkness, or even create your own using the tools at your disposal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eliminate your enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/1d01ee4b9eab376f1d94dba9c3990d37.poster.avif?t=1788167753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/1d01ee4b9eab376f1d94dba9c3990d37.webm?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/1d01ee4b9eab376f1d94dba9c3990d37.mp4?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These infected guards and civilians are a real threat, and the infection makes it impossible to kill them by normal means, but if you are stealthy enough, you can tear out the gangrenous growths on their backs. Be careful, don't leave bodies in plain sight, or the entire area will be alerted...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your brain, push away</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/8aa3cb5386d1db7094381edc912e07f8.poster.avif?t=1788167753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/8aa3cb5386d1db7094381edc912e07f8.webm?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/8aa3cb5386d1db7094381edc912e07f8.mp4?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you can't fight and defeat infected enemies, you can still use your force to push away your foes, on the ground, off a cliff, on thorned barricad, … or even fall on them from above. Use the verticality of the Citadel architecture so that your enemies will no longer be a threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One crossbow, multiple bolts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/5d00990b1bfaedbf8cc631d1e9bba0b4.poster.avif?t=1788167753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/5d00990b1bfaedbf8cc631d1e9bba0b4.webm?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/5d00990b1bfaedbf8cc631d1e9bba0b4.mp4?t=1788167753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main tool for surviving and progressing through the Citadel is your crossbow. Various types of bolts can be found throughout your journey, each offering new possibilities. Stay hidden and extinguish torches, reach new heights with rope bolts, or eliminate threats with fire bolts, the choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore your environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795460/extras/cb1893d7cfa448c0f8a1ed09ea7fdfa9.poster.avif?t=1